  "html": "<p>🚨 <strong>OGeez! Popup Event</strong> 🚨<br><strong>When</strong>: <strong>3/14</strong> from <strong>5-7 pm</strong><br><strong>Where</strong>: Highway 90 Dispensary, Marlton NJ</p><p><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/ogeez-nj.png\" alt=\"Delas on ogeez cannabis gummies avialable now at highway 90 dispensary in marlton, new jersey\"></p><p>Join us for a sweet experience with <a href=\"https://ogeezbrands.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>OGeez</strong></a>! Discover New Jersey’s leading cannabis-infused gummy brand known for mouthwatering flavors, consistent effects, and a smooth, enjoyable experience. 🌿🍬</p><p><strong>Explore OGeez’s Signature Gummies:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Peg’s RSO </strong>: Rick Simpson Oil encompasses all of cannabis’s naturally occurring cannabinoids to provide a full-spectrum effect. This ground-breaking gummy offers all RSO’s therapeutic benefits without any of the yucky bitterness. It pairs vital relief with mouthwatering flavor — and it has the bonus of being named after OGeez!’s late founder, Peggy Noonan. 🍊🍓</li><li><strong>The Creams</strong>: This grab bag of gummies includes Blackberries &amp; Cream, Orange Cream and Peaches &amp; Cream. The signature OGeez! double-layer design — a first-of-a-kind — has a puffy, cloud-like texture and the gummies are precisely infused and enhanced with our Sunny Sativa or Mellow Indica terpenes. 🍦🍑</li><li><strong>The Fruits</strong>: The Fruits are a fan favorite. The mix of Watermelon, Red Apple and Peach gummies will make you feel like you just left the orchard with a basket of delicious pickings. They are a reliable classic and the perfect mood booster. The Fruits are precisely infused and available in Sunny Sativa and Mellow Indica.🍉🍎</li></ul><p>OGeez! gummies are crafted with precision to deliver the perfect flavor and targeted effects. With no bitter aftertaste and a smooth, bouncy texture, these gummies are a treat for both seasoned and new consumers.</p><p><strong>Don’t miss out!</strong> Meet the OGeez! team, learn about their journey of creating innovative cannabis gummies, and enjoy exclusive deals on their full line of flavorful edibles. 🍬💚</p><p><a href=\"/?s=ogeez\">Shop Ogeez Now!</a></p>",
